# Generated by scripts/build-interview-index.mjs on every build (prebuild).
# Deliberately NOT committed: a generated artifact that is also tracked drifts
# silently the moment someone edits content without regenerating, which is exactly
# how content.json went 7 lessons stale (review finding RC-0002). CI runs the
# build, so the deploy always carries a freshly compiled corpus.
public/interview-manifest.json
public/interview/
